{"track":"python","category":"기초 문법","level":1,"title":"몫과 나머지","desc":"<p><code>a</code>를 <code>b</code>로 나눈 <b>몫과 나머지</b>를 <code>[몫, 나머지]</code> 리스트로 돌려주는 <code>divmod_pair(a, b)</code>를 만드세요. 몫은 <code>//</code>, 나머지는 <code>%</code> 예요.</p>","starter":"def divmod_pair(a, b):\n    pass\n","solution":"def divmod_pair(a, b):\n    return [a // b, a % b]\n","hint":"<p><code>17 // 5</code> 는 3, <code>17 % 5</code> 는 2예요.</p>","tests":[{"call":"divmod_pair(17, 5)","expected":[3,2],"visible":true},{"call":"divmod_pair(10, 2)","expected":[5,0],"visible":true},{"call":"divmod_pair(7, 10)","expected":[0,7],"visible":false},{"call":"divmod_pair(100, 7)","expected":[14,2],"visible":false},{"call":"divmod_pair(-7, 2)","expected":[-4,1],"visible":false}],"id":"py-025"}